{
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "Most teams still copy data between tools by hand.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 3.194
  },
  {
   "text": "An AI agent can do that work for you.",
   "start": 3.447,
   "end": 5.662
  },
  {
   "text": "Watch what happens when you give it a goal.",
   "start": 5.892,
   "end": 7.818
  },
  {
   "text": "First, the agent opens a browser and searches live data about your competitors.",
   "start": 8.06,
   "end": 12.53
  },
  {
   "text": "Next, it writes Python code in an editor and runs it in a terminal,",
   "start": 12.755,
   "end": 16.326
  },
  {
   "text": "scanning thousands of files in seconds.",
   "start": 16.421,
   "end": 18.563
  },
  {
   "text": "Then it connects GitHub and OpenAI into one automation workflow.",
   "start": 18.774,
   "end": 22.708
  },
  {
   "text": "When something breaks, it sends an instant alert to your team.",
   "start": 22.93,
   "end": 26.17
  },
  {
   "text": "Here is the result.",
   "start": 26.375,
   "end": 27.482
  },
  {
   "text": "Reports that took ten hours now take ten minutes, and productivity grows by 10x.",
   "start": 27.698,
   "end": 32.676
  },
  {
   "text": "A dashboard tracks every task in real time.",
   "start": 32.904,
   "end": 35.407
  },
  {
   "text": "You do not write the steps anymore.",
   "start": 35.642,
   "end": 37.378
  },
  {
   "text": "You describe the outcome, and the agent builds the pipeline.",
   "start": 37.596,
   "end": 40.746
  },
  {
   "text": "Start with one small workflow this week.",
   "start": 40.984,
   "end": 43.07
  },
  {
   "text": "Then let the agent grow it.",
   "start": 43.312,
   "end": 44.795
  },
  {
   "text": "The teams that learn this first will move faster than everyone else.",
   "start": 44.997,
   "end": 48.246
  },
  {
   "text": "Every morning the agent checks your inbox, summarizes the news,",
   "start": 48.489,
   "end": 51.965
  },
  {
   "text": "and prepares a clean report before you finish your coffee.",
   "start": 52.088,
   "end": 54.755
  },
  {
   "text": "Nothing gets lost, nothing gets forgotten, and your team stays focused on real work.",
   "start": 54.951,
   "end": 59.6
  }
 ],
